			"notes": "# Changelog\n - Updated to 26.3\n - Slot implementations are now registered. Existing data that specify the implementation as a class name will continue to work but Mson will print a warning. To update it, register your type using `Mson#registerSlotType(...)` and replace the class name in your model files with the identifier of the type you registered."
